    ) VALUES (
      155, 'Bosu Ball Cable Crunch With Side Bends', 'Bosu Ball Cable Crunch With Side Bends', 'طحن البطن (كرنش) بالكيبل',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Bosu Ball Cable Crunch With Side Bends.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Bosu Ball Cable Crunch With Side Bends.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين طحن البطن (كرنش) بالكيبل.',
      '["Connect a standard handle to each arm of a cable machine, and position them in the most downward position.","Grab a Bosu Ball and position it in front and center of the cable machine.","Lie down on the Bosu Ball with the small of your back arched around the ball. Your rear end should be close to the floor without touching it.","With both hands, reach back and grab the handle of each cable.","With your feet positioned in a wide stance, extend your arms straight out in front of you and in between your knees. Your hands should be at knee level.","Keep your arms straight and in-line with the upward angle of the cable. Elevate your torso in a crunching motion without dropping or bending your arms.","Maintain the rigid position with your arms. Slowly descend back to the starting position with your back arched around the Bosu Ball and your abdominals elongated.","Repeat the same series of movements to failure.","Once you reach failure, keep your abs tight and raise your torso into plank position so your back is elevated off the Bosu Ball.","Lower your arms down to your side; keep them straight. Start doing alternating side bends; reach for your heels! This finishing movement will focus on your obliques."]', '["اتخذ وضعية الانطلاق الصحيحة لتمرين طحن البطن (كرنش) بالكيبل مع شد عضلات الكور.","قم بالحركة بالمدى الحركي الكامل وبتحكم وسيطرة تامة على المسار.","توقف في قمة الانقباض لتركيز الجهد على العضلة المستهدفة مع الزفير.","عد ببطء إلى نقطة البداية مع الحفاظ على استقامة العمود الفقري."]', 'Abs',
      'عضلات البطن والكور', 'Abs', 'Cable',
      'كيبل', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Bosu_Ball_Cable_Crunch_With_Side_Bends/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Bosu_Ball_Cable_Crunch_With_Side_Bends/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Bosu%20Ball%20Cable%20Crunch%20With%20Side%20Bends%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Bosu%20Ball%20Cable%20Crunch%20With%20Side%20Bends%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '[]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
