      199, 'Crunches', 'Crunches', 'طحن البطن (كرنش)',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Crunches.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Crunches.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين طحن البطن (كرنش).',
      '["Lie flat on your back with your feet flat on the ground, or resting on a bench with your knees bent at a 90 degree angle. If you are resting your feet on a bench, place them three to four inches apart and point your toes inward so they touch.","Now place your hands lightly on either side of your head keeping your elbows in. Tip: Don''t lock your fingers behind your head.","While pushing the small of your back down in the floor to better isolate your abdominal muscles, begin to roll your shoulders off the floor.","Continue to push down as hard as you can with your lower back as you contract your abdominals and exhale. Your shoulders should come up off the floor only about four inches, and your lower back should remain on the floor. At the top of the movement, contract your abdominals hard and keep the contraction for a second. Tip: Focus on slow, controlled movement - don''t cheat yourself by using momentum.","After the one second contraction, begin to come down slowly again to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["اتخذ وضعية الانطلاق الصحيحة لتمرين طحن البطن (كرنش) مع شد عضلات الكور.","قم بالحركة بالمدى الحركي الكامل وبتحكم وسيطرة تامة على المسار.","توقف في قمة الانقباض لتركيز الجهد على العضلة المستهدفة مع الزفير.","عد ببطء إلى نقطة البداية مع الحفاظ على استقامة العمود الفقري."]', 'Abs',
      'عضلات البطن والكور', 'Abs', 'body only',
      'أدوات الجيم', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Crunches/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Crunches/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Crunches%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Crunches%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '[]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
    ) ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET
