      729, 'Flexor Incline Dumbbell Curls', 'Flexor Incline Dumbbell Curls', 'كيرل بايسبس بالدمبلز',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Flexor Incline Dumbbell Curls.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Flexor Incline Dumbbell Curls.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين كيرل بايسبس بالدمبلز.',
      '["Hold the dumbbell towards the side farther from you so that you have more weight on the side closest to you. (This can be done for a good effect on all bicep dumbbell exercises). Now do a normal incline dumbbell curl, but keep your wrists as far back as possible so as to neutralize any stress that is placed on them.","Sit on an incline bench that is angled at 45-degrees while holding a dumbbell on each hand.","Let your arms hang down on your sides, with the elbows in, and turn the palms of your hands forward with the thumbs pointing away from the body. Tip: You will keep this hand position throughout the movement as there should not be any twisting of the hands as they come up. This will be your starting position.","Curl up the two dumbbells at the same time until your biceps are fully contracted and exhale. Tip: Do not swing the arms or use momentum. Keep a controlled motion at all times. Hold the contracted position for a second at the top.","As you inhale, slowly go back to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["ثبّت الكوعين بجانب الجسم تماماً وحافظ على استقامة المعصم لأداء كيرل بايسبس بالدمبلز.","قم بثني أو مد الذراعين بالمسار الكامل للحركة مع التركيز على انقباض العضلة.","اعصر العضلة بقوة لمدة ثانية كاملة في قمة الانقباض مع الزفير.","ارجع بالوزن ببطء خلال 3 ثوانٍ لتحقيق أقصى تمدد عضلي مفيد."]', 'Biceps',
      'البايسبس', 'Biceps', 'Dumbbell',
      'دمبلز', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Flexor_Incline_Dumbbell_Curls/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Flexor_Incline_Dumbbell_Curls/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Flexor%20Incline%20Dumbbell%20Curls%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Flexor%20Incline%20Dumbbell%20Curls%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '[]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
