      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Chest%20Push%20(multiple%20response)%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Chest%20Push%20(multiple%20response)%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["abdominals","shoulders","triceps"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
