      1285, 'Power Snatch', 'Power Snatch', 'رفعة الخطف الأولمبية بالبار',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Power Snatch.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Power Snatch.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين رفعة الخطف الأولمبية بالبار.',
      '["Begin with a loaded barbell on the floor. The bar should be close to or touching the shins, and a wide grip should be taken on the bar. The feet should be directly below the hips, with the feet turned out as needed. Lower the hips, with the chest up and the head looking forward. The shoulders should be just in front of the bar. This will be the starting position.","Begin the first pull by driving through the front of the heels, raising the bar from the ground. The back angle should stay the same until the bar passes the knees.","Transition into the second pull by extending through the hips knees and ankles, driving the bar up as quickly as possible. The bar should be close to the body. At peak extension, shrug the shoulders and allow the elbows to flex to the side.","As you move your feet into the receiving position, a slightly wider position, pull yourself below the bar as you elevate the bar overhead. The bar should be received in a partial squat. Continue raising the bar to the overhead position, receiving the bar locked out overhead.","Return to a standing position with the weight over head."]', '["قف مع مباعدة القدمين باتساع مناسب وثبّت الكعبين على الأرض لأداء رفعة الخطف الأولمبية بالبار.","انزل بالحوض للأسفل والخلف مع الحفاظ على استقامة الظهر وعضلات البطن مشدودة.","ادفع الأرض بقوة عبر باطن القدم للعودة للأعلى مع الزفير وعصر عضلات الفخذ والأرداف.","كرر الحركة بتحكم وسلاسة وتجنب قفل مفاصل الركبة بعنف في قمة الحركة."]', 'Hamstrings',
      'الفخذ الخلفي والأرداف', 'Hamstrings', 'Barbell',
      'بار', 'Beginner', 'olympic weightlifting',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Power_Snatch/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Power_Snatch/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Power%20Snatch%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Power%20Snatch%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["calves","glutes","lower back","quadriceps","shoulders","traps","triceps"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
    ) ON CONFLICT ("id") DO UPDATE SET
