      1342, 'Smith Machine Stiff-Legged Deadlift', 'Smith Machine Stiff-Legged Deadlift', 'ديدليفت بأرجل مستقيمة بجهاز السمث',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Smith Machine Stiff-Legged Deadlift.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Smith Machine Stiff-Legged Deadlift.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين ديدليفت بأرجل مستقيمة بجهاز السمث.',
      '["To begin, set the bar on the smith machine to a height that is around the middle of your thighs. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, grasp the bar using a pronated (palms forward) grip that is shoulder width apart. You may need some wrist wraps if using a significant amount of weight.","Lift the bar up by fully extending your arms while keeping your back straight. Stand with your torso straight and your legs spaced using a shoulder width or narrower stance. The knees should be slightly bent. This is your starting position.","Keeping the knees stationary, lower the barbell to over the top of your feet by bending at the waist while keeping your back straight. Keep moving forward as if you were going to pick something from the floor until you feel a stretch on the hamstrings. Exhale as you perform this movement","Start bringing your torso up straight again as soon as you feel the hamstrings stretch by extending your hips and waist until you are back at the starting position. Inhale as you perform this movement.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["قف مع مباعدة القدمين باتساع مناسب وثبّت الكعبين على الأرض لأداء ديدليفت بأرجل مستقيمة بجهاز السمث.","انزل بالحوض للأسفل والخلف مع الحفاظ على استقامة الظهر وعضلات البطن مشدودة.","ادفع الأرض بقوة عبر باطن القدم للعودة للأعلى مع الزفير وعصر عضلات الفخذ والأرداف.","كرر الحركة بتحكم وسلاسة وتجنب قفل مفاصل الركبة بعنف في قمة الحركة."]', 'Hamstrings',
      'الفخذ الخلفي والأرداف', 'Hamstrings', 'Machine',
      'جهاز', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Stiff-Legged_Deadlift/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Smith_Machine_Stiff-Legged_Deadlift/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Smith%20Machine%20Stiff-Legged%20Deadlift%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Smith%20Machine%20Stiff-Legged%20Deadlift%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["glutes","lower back"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
