    ) VALUES (
      1465, 'Elevated Cable Rows', 'Elevated Cable Rows', 'تجديف للظهر (رو) مرتفع بالكيبل',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Elevated Cable Rows.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Elevated Cable Rows.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين تجديف للظهر (رو) مرتفع بالكيبل.',
      '["Get a platform of some sort (it can be an aerobics or calf raise platform) that is around 4-6 inches in height.","Place it on the seat of the cable row machine.","Sit down on the machine and place your feet on the front platform or crossbar provided making sure that your knees are slightly bent and not locked.","Lean over as you keep the natural alignment of your back and grab the V-bar handles.","With your arms extended pull back until your torso is at a 90-degree angle from your legs. Your back should be slightly arched and your chest should be sticking out. You should be feeling a nice stretch on your lats as you hold the bar in front of you. This is the starting position of the exercise.","Keeping the torso stationary, pull the handles back towards your torso while keeping the arms close to it until you touch the abdominals. Breathe out as you perform that movement. At that point you should be squeezing your back muscles hard. Hold that contraction for a second and slowly go back to the original position while breathing in.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["ثبّت الصدر للأمام والظهر مستقيماً لبدء تجديف للظهر (رو) مرتفع بالكيبل بثبات تام للحوض.","ابدأ حركة السحب بقيادة الكوعين للخلف باتجاه الخصر وليس بسحب المعصم.","اعصر عضلات الظهر بقوة لمدة ثانية في ذروة الانقباض العضلي مع الزفير.","أعد المقاومة ببطء إلى وضعية البداية مع تمديد عضلات الظهر تدريجياً دون تقويس العمود الفقري."]', 'Back',
      'الظهر', 'Back', 'Cable',
      'كيبل', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Elevated_Cable_Rows/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Elevated_Cable_Rows/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Elevated%20Cable%20Rows%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Elevated%20Cable%20Rows%20tutorial%20form',
