      'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/master/exercises/Kipping_Muscle_Up/0.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Kipping%20Muscle%20Up%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Kipping%20Muscle%20Up%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["Biceps Brachii"," Rear Deltoids"," Forearms"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
