      1750, 'Seated Head Harness Neck Resistance', 'Seated Head Harness Neck Resistance', 'تمرين عضلات الجسم جالساً',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Seated Head Harness Neck Resistance.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Seated Head Harness Neck Resistance.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين تمرين عضلات الجسم جالساً.',
      '["Place a neck strap on the floor at the end of a flat bench. Once you have selected the weights, sit at the end of the flat bench with your feet wider than shoulder width apart from each other. Your toes should be pointed out.","Slowly move your torso forward until it is almost parallel with the floor. Using both hands, securely position the neck strap around your head. Tip: Make sure the weights are still lying on the floor to prevent any strain on the neck. Now grab the weight with both hands while elevating your torso back until it is almost perpendicular to the floor. Note: Your head and torso needs to be slightly tilted forward to perform this exercise.","Now place both hands on top of your knees. This is the starting position.","Slowly lower your neck down until your chin touches the upper part of your chest while breathing in.","While exhaling, bring your neck back to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["اتخذ وضعية الانطلاق الصحيحة لتمرين تمرين عضلات الجسم جالساً مع شد عضلات الكور.","قم بالحركة بالمدى الحركي الكامل وبتحكم وسيطرة تامة على المسار.","توقف في قمة الانقباض لتركيز الجهد على العضلة المستهدفة مع الزفير.","عد ببطء إلى نقطة البداية مع الحفاظ على استقامة العمود الفقري."]', 'Full Body',
      'كامل الجسم', 'Full Body', 'other',
      'أدوات الجيم', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Seated_Head_Harness_Neck_Resistance/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Seated_Head_Harness_Neck_Resistance/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Seated%20Head%20Harness%20Neck%20Resistance%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Seated%20Head%20Harness%20Neck%20Resistance%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '[]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
