      'https://musclewiki.com/media/uploads/quads-barbell-squat.gif', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Holman%20Hands-Elevated%20Wide%20Squat%20Thrust%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Holman%20Hands-Elevated%20Wide%20Squat%20Thrust%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["Gluteus Maximus"," Hamstrings"," Calves"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
