      'https://musclewiki.com/media/uploads/shoulders-dumbbells-overhead-press.gif', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=HM%20Single-Leg%20Overhead%20Dumbbell%20Press%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=HM%20Single-Leg%20Overhead%20Dumbbell%20Press%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["Triceps Brachii"," Upper Chest"," Trapezius"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
