      2945, 'Cable Rope Rear-Delt Rows', 'Cable Rope Rear-Delt Rows', 'تجديف للظهر (رو) بالكيبل',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Cable Rope Rear-Delt Rows.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Cable Rope Rear-Delt Rows.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين تجديف للظهر (رو) بالكيبل.',
      '["Sit in the same position on a low pulley row station as you would if you were doing seated cable rows for the back.","Attach a rope to the pulley and grasp it with an overhand grip. Your arms should be extended and parallel to the floor with the elbows flared out.","Keep your lower back upright and slide your hips back so that your knees are slightly bent. This will be your starting position.","Pull the cable attachment towards your upper chest, just below the neck, as you keep your elbows up and out to the sides. Continue this motion as you exhale until the elbows travel slightly behind the back. Tip: Keep your upper arms horizontal, perpendicular to the torso and parallel to the floor throughout the motion.","Go back to the initial position where the arms are extended and the shoulders are stretched forward. Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["قف أو اجلس باستقامة تامة مع شد عضلات الجذع لتنفيذ تجديف للظهر (رو) بالكيبل.","ارفع المقاومة بالمسار المخصص مع إبقاء الأكتاف منخفضة وبعيدة عن الرقبة.","توقف لجزء من الثانية في قمة الحركة لعزل الرأس المستهدف من الدالية.","انزل ببطء وتحكم كامل مع الحفاظ على التوتر العضلي طوال المسار السلبي."]', 'Shoulders',
      'الأكتاف', 'Shoulders', 'Cable',
      'كيبل', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Cable_Rope_Rear-Delt_Rows/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Cable_Rope_Rear-Delt_Rows/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Cable%20Rope%20Rear-Delt%20Rows%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Cable%20Rope%20Rear-Delt%20Rows%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["biceps","middle back"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
