      3064, 'Oblique Crunches', 'Oblique Crunches', 'طحن البطن (كرنش)',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Oblique Crunches.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Oblique Crunches.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين طحن البطن (كرنش).',
      '["Lie flat on the floor with your lower back pressed to the ground. For this exercise, you will need to put one hand beside your head and the other to the side against the floor.","Make sure your feet are elevated and resting on a flat surface.","Now lift the shoulder in which your hand is touching your head.","Simply elevate your shoulder and body upward until you touch your knee. For example, if you have your right hand besides your head, then you want to elevate your body upwards until your right elbow touches your left knee. The same variation can be applied doing the inverse and using your left elbow to touch your right knee.","After your knee touches your elbow, lower your body until you have reached the starting position.","Remember to breathe in during the eccentric (lowering) part of the exercise and to breathe out during the concentric (upward) part of the exercise.","Continue alternating in this manner until all of the recommended repetitions for each side have been completed."]', '["اتخذ وضعية الانطلاق الصحيحة لتمرين طحن البطن (كرنش) مع شد عضلات الكور.","قم بالحركة بالمدى الحركي الكامل وبتحكم وسيطرة تامة على المسار.","توقف في قمة الانقباض لتركيز الجهد على العضلة المستهدفة مع الزفير.","عد ببطء إلى نقطة البداية مع الحفاظ على استقامة العمود الفقري."]', 'Abs',
      'عضلات البطن والكور', 'Abs', 'body only',
      'أدوات الجيم', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Oblique_Crunches/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Oblique_Crunches/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Oblique%20Crunches%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Oblique%20Crunches%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '[]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
