      3164, 'Standing Palms-Up Barbell Behind The Back Wrist Curl', 'Standing Palms-Up Barbell Behind The Back Wrist Curl', 'كيرل بايسبس واقفاً بالبار',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Standing Palms-Up Barbell Behind The Back Wrist Curl.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Standing Palms-Up Barbell Behind The Back Wrist Curl.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين كيرل بايسبس واقفاً بالبار.',
      '["Start by standing straight and holding a barbell behind your glutes at arm''s length while using a pronated grip (palms will be facing back away from the glutes) and having your hands shoulder width apart from each other.","You should be looking straight forward while your feet are shoulder width apart from each other. This is the starting position.","While exhaling, slowly elevate the barbell up by curling your wrist in a semi-circular motion towards the ceiling. Note: Your wrist should be the only body part moving for this exercise.","Hold the contraction for a second and lower the barbell back down to the starting position while inhaling.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.","When finished, lower the barbell down to the squat rack or the floor by bending the knees. Tip: It is easiest to either pick it up from a squat rack or have a partner hand it to you."]', '["ثبّت الكوعين بجانب الجسم تماماً وحافظ على استقامة المعصم لأداء كيرل بايسبس واقفاً بالبار.","قم بثني أو مد الذراعين بالمسار الكامل للحركة مع التركيز على انقباض العضلة.","اعصر العضلة بقوة لمدة ثانية كاملة في قمة الانقباض مع الزفير.","ارجع بالوزن ببطء خلال 3 ثوانٍ لتحقيق أقصى تمدد عضلي مفيد."]', 'Forearms',
      'السواعد', 'Forearms', 'Barbell',
      'بار', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Standing_Palms-Up_Barbell_Behind_The_Back_Wrist_Curl/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Standing_Palms-Up_Barbell_Behind_The_Back_Wrist_Curl/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Standing%20Palms-Up%20Barbell%20Behind%20The%20Back%20Wrist%20Curl%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Standing%20Palms-Up%20Barbell%20Behind%20The%20Back%20Wrist%20Curl%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '[]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
      '["استخدام الزخم الحركي وأرجحة الجسم بدلاً من التركيز على عزل العضلة.","النزول السريع بدون تحكم في الوزن مما يقلل الاستفادة ويزيد فرصة الإصابة.","تقليل المدى الحركي الكامل من أجل رفع أوزان زائدة تفوق القدرة."]', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
