      3910, 'Wger Exercise Strength 3d2adf99', 'Wger Exercise Strength 3d2adf99', 'تمرين الأكتاف',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Wger Exercise Strength 3d2adf99.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Wger Exercise Strength 3d2adf99.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين تمرين الأكتاف.',
      '["Setup: Lie back or stand securely with your core engaged, feet firmly planted, and grip the Gym mat at shoulder width","Execution: Inhale and lower the weight in a controlled motion until your elbows reach approximately 90 degrees or a comfortable full stretch","Contraction: Exhale and press the weight upward focusing on contracting the Shoulders, without locking out elbows abruptly","Recovery: Pause briefly at peak contraction before repeating for target repetitions"]', '["قف أو اجلس باستقامة تامة مع شد عضلات الجذع لتنفيذ تمرين الأكتاف.","ارفع المقاومة بالمسار المخصص مع إبقاء الأكتاف منخفضة وبعيدة عن الرقبة.","توقف لجزء من الثانية في قمة الحركة لعزل الرأس المستهدف من الدالية.","انزل ببطء وتحكم كامل مع الحفاظ على التوتر العضلي طوال المسار السلبي."]', 'Shoulders',
      'الأكتاف', 'Shoulders', 'Mat',
      'فرشة رياضية', 'Beginner', 'STRENGTH',
      4.8, 'BeastMode-Enriched-Baseline', 'https://musclewiki.com/media/uploads/shoulders-dumbbells-overhead-press.gif', 'https://musclewiki.com/media/uploads/shoulders-dumbbells-overhead-press.gif',
      'https://musclewiki.com/media/uploads/shoulders-dumbbells-overhead-press.gif', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wger%20Exercise%20Strength%203d2adf99%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Wger%20Exercise%20Strength%203d2adf99%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["Triceps Brachii"," Upper Chest"," Trapezius"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
