      4164, 'Machine Shoulder (Military) Press', 'Machine Shoulder (Military) Press', 'تمرين الأكتاف بالجهاز',
      'Master guide and execution tutorial for Machine Shoulder (Military) Press.', 'Master guide and execution tutorial for Machine Shoulder (Military) Press.', 'الدليل الاحترافي وخطوات الأداء الصحيح لتمرين تمرين الأكتاف بالجهاز.',
      '["Sit down on the Shoulder Press Machine and select the weight.","Grab the handles to your sides as you keep the elbows bent and in line with your torso. This will be your starting position.","Now lift the handles as you exhale and you extend the arms fully. At the top of the position make sure that you hold the contraction for a second.","Lower the handles slowly back to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."]', '["قف أو اجلس باستقامة تامة مع شد عضلات الجذع لتنفيذ تمرين الأكتاف بالجهاز.","ارفع المقاومة بالمسار المخصص مع إبقاء الأكتاف منخفضة وبعيدة عن الرقبة.","توقف لجزء من الثانية في قمة الحركة لعزل الرأس المستهدف من الدالية.","انزل ببطء وتحكم كامل مع الحفاظ على التوتر العضلي طوال المسار السلبي."]', 'Shoulders',
      'الأكتاف', 'Shoulders', 'Machine',
      'جهاز', 'Beginner', 'strength',
      4.8, 'Free-Exercise-DB', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Shoulder_Military_Press/0.jpg', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/exercises/Machine_Shoulder_Military_Press/0.jpg',
      '', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Machine%20Shoulder%20(Military)%20Press%20tutorial%20form', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Machine%20Shoulder%20(Military)%20Press%20tutorial%20form',
      '', '["triceps"]',
      '[]', '["Using excessive body momentum and swinging instead of muscle isolation.","Rushing through the eccentric phase without controlling the weight.","Sacrificing full range of motion for heavier loads."]',
